{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6326","title":"A New Chapter for Xiaomi Auto: Xiaomi Unveils Xiaomi Kunlun Technical Architecture and Debuts Xiaomi SkyNomad Series","desc":"A completely flat floor, industry-leading range, and Xiaomi's most advanced safety architecture headline the new Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max and Xiaomi SKyNomad N70 Max","view_cnt":"210390","like_cnt":"7","add_time":"1785417793","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/792_operatorx_operatorx_opx/30/07/2026/ae4b202b24c503698996adaa70e85ade.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, China, July 30, 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e— Xiaomi Auto today unveiled its all-new Xiaomi SkyNomad Series, the first model built on Xiaomi Kunlun Platform at Xiaomi SkyNomad Technology Launch Event. Positioned as an intelligent, reconfigurable, large-space SUV, Xiaomi SkyNomad is built around three core strengths — expansive interior space, a completely flat cabin floor, and reconfigurable seating — paired with the Xiaomi Kunlun HyperRange, Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery, and Xiaomi Kunlun Total Safety. Across space, safety, intelligence, driving dynamics, and range, Xiaomi SkyNomad is designed to meet the core needs of family vehicle ownership — marking the opening of a new chapter in Xiaomi's automotive journey.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis launch introduces two variants:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;SKyNomad\u0026nbsp;N90 Max —\u0026nbsp;Flagship 7-Seater Extended-Range\u0026nbsp;SUV\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eand\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad\u0026nbsp;N70 Max —\u0026nbsp;5-Seat\u0026nbsp;AWD\u0026nbsp;Extended-Range SUV\u003c/strong\u003e, catering to the versatile spatial needs of different families.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"text-align: center; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;SkyNomad Series Official Pre-Sale Price\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;SkyNomad\u0026nbsp;N90 Max\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Flagship 7-Seater Extended-Range\u0026nbsp;SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRMB\u0026nbsp;299,900\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;SkyNomad\u0026nbsp;N70 Max\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;5-Seat AWD Extended-Range\u0026nbsp;SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRMB\u0026nbsp;259,900\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign that stands the test of time. Design born for space.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Auto designs for longevity, and Xiaomi SkyNomad's design philosophy can be summed up in one phrase:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eform follows function.\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Where traditional large SUVs finalize styling, powertrain, and chassis first and treat interior space as whatever is left over, Xiaomi SkyNomad reverses that order — function leads, and every design feature traces back to a specific spatial need.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBold, upright proportions — every line serves the space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat spatial logic shows up directly in the body: Xiaomi SkyNomad's squared-off proportions are effectively a projection of the interior space — an SUV exterior wrapped around MPV-level interior volume. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max, a large extended-range SUV, measures 5,285 mm long, 1,998 mm wide, and 1,825 mm tall, on a 3,080 mm wheelbase. Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max, a mid-to-large extended-range SUV, measures 4,960 mm × 1,998 mm × 1,765 mm, on a 2,950 mm wheelbase.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/589_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/59aa30c8c60394e1d374a27693b66761.jpg\" alt=\"A cyan SUV named \u0026quot;SKYNOMAD,\u0026quot; showcased from the side against a light-colored background. The car's design is modern, featuring unique wheels.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree lines define the upright stance:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ea flat roofline\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that maximizes second- and third-row headroom;\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ea continuous waistline\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that stretches the profile; and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ea rising sill line\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that lifts the visual center of gravity for a more commanding presence. Front and rear lights sit at nearly the same height, giving the car a stable, balanced, upscale look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003erounded-rectangle\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;motif carries through the headlights, taillights, door handles, and side cameras for a cohesive, orderly design language. The dragonfly-shaped headlights evolve the classic cross pattern into the front fascia; the halo taillight transforms into an inverted U-shape. Xiaomi SkyNomad incorporates over\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e140 aerodynamic optimizations\u003c/strong\u003e, including a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003estandard active grille across the range\u003c/strong\u003e, achieving a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003edrag coefficient of 0.255\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/583_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/905f172b967ceffe36f74601b7d09bd6.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart electric doors\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;open by touch or voice;\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003erear doors open to nearly 90°\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for easy entry and exit. A\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e360° anti-collision system\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;uses AI to detect obstacles near open doors and can actively resist opening or sound a warning. Second- and third-row privacy curtains create a private space for the cabin. An optional\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eelectric side step\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;(aluminum-alloy, rated to 300 kg per side, tested through 100,000 open/close cycles) assists entry for children and older passengers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/349_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/ad59e57d256bd8205b0afcb7366c39cf.jpg\" alt=\"A close-up of the car's side mirror, with the mirror and window frame displaying a dark metallic sheen, set against a black background, and brown seats visible inside the car.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePremium-grade materials, throughout. A cabin that feels warm, elevated.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrawing on residential interior design, Xiaomi SkyNomad's cabin aims for a simple, elevated, homelike atmosphere. A\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ecabinet-style center console\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;extends 1,530 mm horizontally for a wider visual and physical footprint. A new two-spoke steering wheel shares its grip profile with Xiaomi SU7. Hidden mechanical air vents keep the dashboard clean while retaining precise manual adjustment. A threaded accessory port delivers\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;27W fast charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for phone mounts, action cameras, and similar accessories.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/332_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/b52ddf9f8e2656ab097fea4d69c76196.jpg\" alt=\"The in-car perspective showcases a luxurious interior, with light-colored leather seats and panels. A large screen displays information in the center, while the steering wheel and console have a modern design, creating an overall spacious and comfortable environment.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e95% of high-touch interior surfaces of Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Series are\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003esoft-wrapped\u003c/strong\u003e, covering up to 32 m² — far exceeding the class average — virtually eliminating hard plastic in all hand, elbow, shoulder, and knee contact zones. The entire\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e32 m² interior carries OEKO-TEX® certification\u003c/strong\u003e, applying infant-grade safety standards to the cabin. Infants under 3 can touch every surface without risk of allergy or harmful substance migration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Series' front and second-row seatbacks use a 12-layer comfort structure for a \"big sofa\" feel. Front seats come standard with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e16-point massage, ventilation, and heating\u003c/strong\u003e; up to four zero-gravity seats are available across the trims.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/125_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/e1d72f7306f8daea22c20f7fb2bed073.jpg\" alt=\"The back seat of the car is upholstered in brown leather, with seats designed with diamond stitching, a simple surrounding environment, and soft light filtering through the windows.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtensive personalization options — a way to express every aesthetic\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSince Xiaomi Auto's debut, its distinctive sense of color has produced a series of car colors that have won broad market appeal. This time, the SkyNomad series introduces two new exterior colors: \u003cstrong\u003eMountain Green\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eValley Blue\u003c/strong\u003e, alongside a classic \u003cstrong\u003eVolcanic Gray\u003c/strong\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMountain Green:\u0026nbsp;Inspired by the color philosophy of ink wash painting, the muted blue-green of mountains shrouded in mist, soft yet resolute, verdant without being vivid.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/293_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/aaa9506096f4c9eefc76ac0283a1e0ff.jpg\" alt=\"A green SUV is parked against a backdrop of misty mountains, featuring a modern body design and large wheels. The front emblem displays the brand name \u0026quot;SKY NOMAD,\u0026quot; and the license plate number is \u0026quot;N90.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eValley Blue:\u0026nbsp;A layered image blending natural wonder, spiritual vitality, and cultural metaphor, the clear, ethereal blue of a mountain stream deep in a secluded valley.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/754_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/35fa3e8bcf12df84fcc0b7ade728c03d.jpg\" alt=\"A blue SUV is parked against a snowy background, with a modern appearance and streamlined body design. The front features a prominent brand logo and LED lights. Overall, it looks suitable for various driving environments.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eVolcanic Gray:\u0026nbsp;Derived from the original\u0026nbsp;hue\u0026nbsp;of dormant volcanic rock veins, a high-purity gray overlaid with nano-scale mineral particles, revealing a refined, layered metallic texture under shifting light.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/649_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/5b539b89c35551e70bf52acfad796447.jpg\" alt=\"A gray SUV is stationary against a desolate backdrop, with smooth body lines and uniquely designed wheels. In the distance, gentle mountains and the sky can be seen.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe interior offers\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eCream Beige\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eMocha Brown\u003c/strong\u003e, both inspired by nature. These two \"premium finishing styles\" cater to different aesthetic preferences.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eCream Beige: Fine sand-beige as the primary tone, accented with chestnut brown — a low-saturation, soft-textured palette that creates an open, serene atmosphere reminiscent of the wilderness.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eMocha Brown: The primary tone drawn from the natural color of deep-valley soil, paired with light ash-wood grain reminiscent of Nordic ash — transforming the cabin into a mobile forest cabin.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/992_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/eaf6a9297c3d122afc68bc80c93a6002.jpg\" alt=\"Luxury car interior, with light brown leather seats, exquisitely designed, featuring an armrest and cup holders in the center. The interior space is spacious, with a sunroof on top, creating a modern and comfortable overall atmosphere.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max wheel options include standard\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e21\" Prism-shaped Rims\u003c/strong\u003e, plus optional\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e21\" Beam-shaped Rims\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;(luxury-oriented) and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e21\" Starburst-shaped Rims Stealth Black Edition\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e(sport-oriented). Bridgestone quiet-tuned tires are standard across the range.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/464_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/7d21039378ca638671f95f31ee33b202.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpace: Redefining What an\u0026nbsp;SUV\u0026nbsp;Interior Can Do\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi's approach starts from a simple question:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ewhy should people adapt to\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;space, instead of\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;space adapting to them?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eTraditional large SUVs fix styling, powertrain, and chassis first, and space is whatever is left over — fixed seat orientation, uneven fold-flat surfaces, not enough room for everyone's luggage. Xiaomi SkyNomad's Kunlun Platform reverses that: it defines what the space needs to do first, then engineers the architecture around it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;Kunlun Platform — built specifically for space.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Platform optimizes packaging across three axes to minimize structural intrusion into the cabin:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eX-axis — Front cabin integration frees interior space:\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;A five-in-one EREV system, integrated water-cooling module, integrated refrigerant module, mid-mounted HVAC unit, and PTC-compressor two-in-one compress the front cabin length to just 1,265 mm. Every millimeter saved up front translates directly into more usable space inside.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eY-axis — Third-row wheel-arch optimization:\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Springs and shock absorbers are separated into a split layout, releasing 15 mm of wheel-arch height for the third row compared to traditional large SUVs. Moving the shock absorbers outward with a shallow-angle installation optimizes the overall wheel-arch packaging, combined with third-row HVAC ducting redesign, delivering a squared-off,\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003efull-cabin spatial experience.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZ-axis — Eliminating the step between the second and third rows:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eFocused on rear electric drive unit integration and rear suspension design,\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ea highly integrated rear coaxial electric drive\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;frees 145 mm of vertical space. An\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eintegrated-linkage independent suspension\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;uses an H-arm structure where the air spring sits inside the arm, lowering the floor by another 37 mm. Additionally, the large battery pack is redesigned with the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ebattery pack control module relocated inside, reducing floor thickness by 180 mm\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;— achieving a completely flat second-row floor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/132_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/1b7ad8ff480fb65060d972350a0b3e80.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe result is a flat floor running from row one through the cargo area — uninterrupted, and unusual for the large extended-range SUV segment. Every structural line is built toward the same goal with Xiaomi Kunlun Platform: the largest, flattest, most flexible space for the people inside.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/869_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/a3111f52d1fd2752b5b2820f7f98c3a8.jpg\" alt=\"The seats inside the car are made of brown leather, featuring an exquisite design that conveys a sense of luxury. The seats are equipped with backrests and armrests, and the overall layout is spacious, set against a minimalist interior environment.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeating for Seven, Cargo for Seven — MPV-Level Space Inside an\u0026nbsp;SUV\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad Series delivers class-leading in-cabin seating space. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Series offers\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e2,760 mm of total occupant space\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;across the vehicle, with second-row legroom reaching up to 1.55 m — enough to sit with legs fully stretched out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBeyond spacious seating, the cargo area expands to a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003emaximum of 1,831 L\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;— fitting \u003cstrong\u003eseven 20-inch suitcases\u003c/strong\u003e while all seven passengers ride in comfort. In Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max's Ultimate Storage Mode, it holds up to \u003cstrong\u003e24 20-inch suitcases\u003c/strong\u003e. For a family camping trip, comfortably load a canopy tent, a camping trailer, a foldable roll-up table, a barbecue grill, five moon chairs, and three storage boxes — and still enjoy every bit of the campsite.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/941_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/609b2527c208b31597453fee36e9a1d2.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe cabin includes\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;34 storage compartments\u003c/strong\u003e, including an 18.4 L front passenger glovebox (fits seven 13\" laptops) and extended door-panel storage. Up to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e12 accessory ports\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;support flexible device mounting. Rear doors open to nearly 90°, with a 1,258 mm entry aperture, a low sill height, and an optional electric step, for easy entry and exit.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/872_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/94579027174fb32696dc2319a8a8d9e2.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully flat floor, front to back. Maximum space, total openness.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of the core pain points of traditional large SUVs is the step between the second/third rows and the cargo area — a fragmented space that severely limits flexibility. Xiaomi SkyNomad Series comes standard with a completely flat floor across all trims: from rows one through three to the boot, the entire cabin features a flat floor with just a 2.95° slope, spanning nearly 3 meters in length with a maximum flat area exceeding 4.4 m² — eliminating the step design common in traditional large SUVs for a continuous, flexible space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/462_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/1b666fcd12326eb5080b51e3955c3948.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt on this flat floor, every model comes standard with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eextra-long seat slide rails\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;—\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eup to 1,938 mm\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max, \u003cstrong\u003ethe longest of any\u0026nbsp;SUV\u0026nbsp;in its class\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;— with 900 mm of travel for both second and third rows, far exceeding comparable models. The rails use aerospace-grade 7-series reinforced aluminum alloy, rated to 54 kN lock strength and 57 kN peel strength, and validated through 15,000 cycles with no loosening or functional degradation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA standard\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ecabinet-style sliding center console\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;— deployable when needed, retracting flush when not — integrates 50W wireless charging, a 9 L compressor refrigerator (fits up to ten 330 ml cans upright), dual USB-C ports, and accessory expansion, combining sliding, charging, cooling, storage, and connectivity in one unit.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/445_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/4457502d0e46f196b5e2df2711d1cb62.jpg\" alt=\"The central armrest area of the car is equipped with two cup holders and a pull-out storage drawer, with a background of dark carpet and beige interior.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll seats are power-adjustable; front seats include\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e16-point massage, ventilation, and heating\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;as standard. Front seatbacks use an industry-leading 15-layer comfort structure — 20 mm of zero-pressure-feel foam over a 65 kg/m³ high-density base — with a three-layer cushion design balancing surface softness and underlying support for fatigue-free long drives. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max supports\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003efour-seat zero-gravity\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;mode across the front and second rows. Optional front-seat configurations include\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ezero-gravity\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;recline, unlocking a mobile first-class experience for immersive rest, \u003cstrong\u003eorrotating seats\u003c/strong\u003e, which turn the cabin into an interactive lounge for face-to-face conversation with family and friends in the rear, or for playing with kids during a break.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e7+N Scenarios — Change Your Seating, Change Your Space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRather than a small set of engineer-defined modes, Xiaomi SkyNomad's variable space is designed around real usage patterns — rest, family time, camping, business meetings — enabled by high seat and rail flexibility. Configurations include:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBusiness Lounge Face-to-Face, Family Lakeside Seating\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFront seats rotate: the four independent seats in the first and second rows face each other, while the third row folds and slides back to free up 720 mm of legroom.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe third row slides back and the seat cushions fold up to create an extra-large play area — instantly turning into a mobile play fort for kids.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePair with the folding table, rear entertainment screens, and factory-installed second/third-row sunshades to elevate the in-cabin experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExecutive Four-Seat Business Reception, Everyday Four-Seat Travel\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFirst-Class Mode: second and third rows slide all the way back, with second-row legroom reaching up to 1,550 mm — instantly turning into a first-class cabin with room for very long legs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSecond-row zero-gravity seats can also be engaged, reaching an industry-leading zero-gravity posture at a 128° hip angle and 130° knee angle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf storage is needed, one-touch convenient storage mode accommodates 4 passengers in comfort while fitting 16 20-inch suitcases.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuper-Size Bed for Naps, Overnight Camping\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFront seats stay occupied while one touch turns the second and third rows into a bed — suited for a midday nap or a long rest.\u003cimg src=\"https://i02.appmifile.com/200_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/d7a879c0d8afc01394f78499aa3c59f7.png\" alt=\"The interior of the car is arranged to look like a bed, with a white mattress placed at the back of the car, surrounded by brown seats and interior decor. The windows are large, allowing for bright light.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlternatively, after flattening the second and third rows into a bed, the front and passenger seats can rotate to extend the bed to a maximum length of 2,300 mm, giving you a fully stretched-out sleeping space whenever you need it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum Cargo Mode, Your Moving-Day Hero\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne touch activates Ultimate Storage Mode: 1,260 mm of cargo depth and a maximum expanded volume of 1,831 L, fitting up to 24 20-inch suitcases.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll Seven Family Members in Comfort\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor everyday trips with all 7 family members, everyone rides comfortably while the cargo area still fits 7 20-inch suitcases — one per person, making short trips effortless.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreator's Personal Studio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne second-row seat serves as a seat while the other enters zero-gravity mode, creating a single-person studio mode for both work and rest.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/548_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/c6598716705d690487e79025478e8b03.png\" alt=\"Luxurious car interior, brown leather seats, equipped with a computer and a coffee cup, with a view of the beach and ocean outside, the environment is peaceful and comfortable.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFamily Camping\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe third-row seat cushions fold up and the backrests fold down, turning the third row into rear-facing scenic seating open to the cargo area — perfect for the whole family to enjoy the outdoors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/82_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/090c4c8366388149cc2e27d2fd15282a.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSafety Above All\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSafety is the foundation of Xiaomi SkyNomad's engineering, addressed through\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Kunlun Total Safety\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003esystem spanning materials, structure, airbags, battery, and the variable-space design itself.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArmor Cage steel-aluminum hybrid body, safeguarding occupants from every direction\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHigh-strength steel and aluminum alloy make up\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e90.4%\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;of Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max body, with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e2,200 MPa ultra-high-strength steel\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eused in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e16 critical locations\u003c/strong\u003e. A\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e2,200 MPa embedded roll cage (A-pillar to C-pillar)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003esupports a maximum roof-crush load of nearly 14 tons, and improves A-pillar load capacity by 24% against underride scenarios. All four doors carry standard\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e2,200 MPa anti-collision beams\u003c/strong\u003e, with anti-detachment hooks on the rear doors. A\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e13-in-1\u003c/strong\u003eintegrated hot-formed door ring spans the A/B/C/D pillars across all three rows, improving side-impact load capacity by 19%. A 2,000 MPa integrated hot-formed front floor frame — laser-welded from multiple high-strength steel panels and stamped as a single piece, with 2,200 MPa reinforcement at critical points — improves occupant survival space by 9% in frontal impacts and 10% in side-pole impacts, while protecting the cabin and battery pack.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/943_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/633273277015e2ada474785af8be1e6b.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll-scenario, all-seat protection — safety coverage that extends to every occupant\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e12 airbags come standard on Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max — the most in its class — protecting all three rows. Dual-chamber far-side airbags in the second row reduce head displacement for the left-side occupant by 34%. 4-point-mounted far-side airbags (versus 2-point) reduce driver head displacement by 24%. Third-row side airbags, paired with a 3,200 mm side curtain, cover head, chest, and waist protection for third-row occupants — reducing shoulder compression by 44% and rib compression by an average of 18% in side impacts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/822_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/2b86257d3624fbbd355c7f01971dceee.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e9 collision sensors, including added front and C-pillar sensors, improve detection across more collision types (including center-pole and rear-side impacts) and airbag deployment precision. Beyond the standard 50th-percentile male test dummy, safety development also covers 5th-percentile female dummies and dedicated second/third-row child protection, across all conditions and seating positions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;Armor Scale Battery\u0026nbsp;— the industry's highest standard for battery quality and safety\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOver five years, Xiaomi has built a 230+ person battery R\u0026amp;D team, filed 697 related patents, and built its own battery pack factory, with cumulative deliveries exceeding 700,000 vehicles. Xiaomi Armor Scale Battery is Xiaomi's end-to-end battery system: Xiaomi defines the product, leads pack design and development, participates in cell design, and manages quality control across the full process.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/523_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/605c925a2b763f4bab008f390e0450e6.jpg\" alt=\"It shows a shelf with multiple rows of batteries in different colors, mainly blue and white, with a label that says \u0026quot;High Safety Control Cells.\u0026quot; The background may be black, highlighting the color and design of the batteries.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi selects cell cathode, anode, electrolyte, and separator materials directly, and has optimized core cell design and manufacturing — reducing cell health degradation by 50% and achieving twice the cycle life of the relevant national standard. The battery includes 18 layers of structural safety protection, maintaining full function — no leak, fire, or explosion — after a 500 J underbody impact. Thermal protection runs up to 16 layers, including extensive aerogel insulation, preventing thermal propagation, fire, or explosion even under 55°C full-charge single-cell thermal runaway — Xiaomi's highest thermal-runaway safety rating to date. A \"Shadow Factory\" quality system gives Xiaomi engineers direct oversight of every module, with full-process traceability from raw material to finished pack.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/165_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/dba16172fe3123340ace6f58678a5356.jpg\" alt=\"Show a model named \u0026quot;SKYNOMAD,\u0026quot; with a layered structure containing several components in different colors, primarily blue and white, with a metal base and a black background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTriple-redundant door handles\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;allow central unlocking and mechanical opening even after a full power loss, with mechanical release handles inside and outside the vehicle. Xiaomi SkyNomad is the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eonly large\u0026nbsp;SUV\u0026nbsp;in its class with dual emergency pull handles\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on the tailgate, letting third-row passengers exit through the rear without climbing into the cargo area. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max is rated for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eemergency wading up to 750 mm\u003c/strong\u003e, with emergency floating capability keeping the cabin free of significant water ingress for 3 minutes in the event of accidental submersion. 26 standard driver-assistance safety features support the full chain from warning to escape.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e39 anti-pinch points\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;across seats, windows, sunshades, and the electric side step keep pinch force below 150 N, reducing the risk of injury — particularly for children.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/301_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/60ec3bc3ac3f2d48ffc0cbc1ae0d43b5.jpg\" alt=\"This is the internal structure of a blue car door, showing an opening that may be used for the installation of some kind of device or component. The background is a smooth blue surface, giving an overall appearance that is very neat and industrial.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntelligence and Ecosystem: AI-powered across every scenario\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhole-home smart integration, delivered in one step\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad's cabin electronics run on a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003efour-in-one domain control module\u003c/strong\u003e, built on the Snapdragon® 8 Gen 3 Mobile Platform (4nm process) for 17% higher CPU and 100% higher AI compute versus the prior generation, with fast app loading and smooth system performance.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eDual\u0026nbsp;5G\u0026nbsp;+ Wi-Fi 7 connectivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;supports flagship-phone-level dual-SIM standby and stronger in-cabin signal and speed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ee-Fuse solid-state power distribution system\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;manages vehicle electrical load more intelligently and safely. An upgraded\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eFlyback low-voltage power system\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;can run Sentry Mode and the onboard refrigerator independently while parked, cutting energy use by 60% versus a non-Flyback system in that scenario.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA customizable\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ehead-up display\u0026nbsp;offers a -4.7° optimal viewing angle\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e15,000-nit brightness\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for clear visibility. Six-screen cabin connectivity allows content to move seamlessly between displays, paired with a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e25-speaker in-house audio system\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for an immersive sound experience. A\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e6.9-inch rear control screen\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eenables full-cabin control from the back seat, including a live exterior sentry-camera view — useful for overnight security while camping.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA variable-space table supports both the sliding console and rail mounting, for work, family time, or shared use, alongside a range of camping accessory options. Up to 6 magnetic mount points around the cabin support accessories — Bluetooth remotes, pet-related mounts, glasses cases — plus NFC touch-to-control tags for one-touch vehicle commands.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/907_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/e98488b7f1fd78b4b9d3e2a92b11c5c0.jpg\" alt=\"The rear central console of the car is equipped with a touchscreen display that shows the temperature settings and other function buttons. Surrounding it is beige leather upholstery, with two cup holders in the center.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Hyper XiaoAi, Xiaomi's onboard AI assistant, can switch among 11 cabin layout modes with a single voice command, coordinating seats, lighting, and climate based on stated intent.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClass-leading assisted driving hardware, XLA architecture that communicates, understands, and reasons\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad comes standard with high-spec assisted-driving hardware: a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e700 TOPS\u003c/strong\u003e onboard compute platform, integrated and forward-facing LiDAR, 4D mmWave radar, and anti-glare cameras — uncommon in this class. Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 series adds\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003erear LiDAR\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;with ranging precision to 2 cm, improving detection of low or overhanging obstacles for safer parking.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi's HAD assisted-driving system, upgraded with the XLA architecture, supports voice-controlled driving (lane changes, acceleration, deceleration via single commands) and space-level navigation guidance in underground parking structures. It ships standard across Xiaomi SkyNomad range, with ongoing improvements planned in voice control, spatial understanding, and predictive assistance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriving\u0026nbsp;Dynamics: Ultra-long range, top-tier energy efficiency, large yet easy to drive\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;Kunlun HyperRange — best-in-class combined range, worry-free long-distance travel\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad's Kunlun HyperRange system uses a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003elarge-battery extended-range architecture\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;to address common EREV pain points — short EV-only range, high combined consumption, weak performance on a depleted battery. Battery capacity ranges from 52 kWh (entry) to 76 kWh. On CLTC, Xiaomi SkyNomad N70 Max reaches up to 505 km of EV-only range (best in its class); Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max reaches 464 km.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA five-in-one SiC range-extending drive unit improves efficiency by 2.65%, reducing consumption to 15.85 kWh/100 km. Combined with a large fuel tank, Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max reaches a combined range of 1,705 km — among the strongest results in the extended-range SUV segment. A fuel-to-electricity conversion ratio of 3.66 kWh/L supports depleted-battery consumption as low as 6.26 L/100 km. Source-and-path vibration isolation plus active noise cancellation keep the range extender close to inaudible in operation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter its first scheduled service, the range-extender unit requires maintenance only every 3 years or 30,000 km — cutting total service costs by 23%. All variants support 92, 95, and 98 octane fuel (applicable in Chinese Mainland).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/821_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/07/2026/81e8a8949a3902169b019cb441d38440.jpg\" alt=\"A car engine model is displayed against a black background, with detailed performance parameters at the bottom, including power and efficiency metrics.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecially designed and tuned for effortless handling of a large vehicle — the whole family can drive with ease\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max carries chassis DNA from Xiaomi SU7 and Xiaomi YU7:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ea double-wishbone front suspension\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for high lateral stiffness and strong anti-roll performance, and an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eH-arm multi-link rear suspension\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for a strong ride/handling balance. Five-stage adjustable air springs and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003econtinuously variable\u0026nbsp;damping\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ebalance comfort and control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDual-motor all-wheel drive delivers 310 kW of peak power, tuned for a linear power delivery similar to a large-displacement engine across the full speed range. Braking from 100–0 km/h takes 38.57 meters, with consistent performance across 10 consecutive stops. Despite a nearly 5.3-meter length, Xiaomi SkyNomad N90 Max has a 5.95 m turning radius, aided by rack-type electric power steering for agile, precise handling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad Series is designed for families with children, buyers seeking independent, flexible SUV interior space, and anyone looking for one vehicle to handle the whole family's needs — combining flagship chassis dynamics, comprehensive safety, an advanced intelligent ecosystem, and long-range efficiency in a single package.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePre-orders for Xiaomi SkyNomad Series open July 30 at 21:00 in Chinese Mainland. A RMB 1,000 deposit secures an order; once the order is locked in, buyers receive priority production scheduling, plus a complimentary RMB 999 in-car dual-cupholder table upon delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images available here:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgDqBWgOMiPZRqQPAkEaLKKiATdiMwLJfMn_JSfXdXDDc0g?e=ZlA8hI\"\u003eXiaomi SkyNomad Series\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisclaimers:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eSome configurations are optional and subject to delivery.\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003eSome features/functions are required to be carried out through OTA.\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003eData in this press release was retrieved from Xiaomi\u003c/em\u003e Auto \u003cem\u003eLab and/or partners, and may vary depending on models/configurations.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience, and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 600,000 units by February 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index. Xiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"2325","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1785418879"},"common":null}